      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>\u1e32a\u1e6d\u012bf</em>:\u00a0It is one of the cities of <em>Ba\u1e25reyn</em> (Bahrayn / Eastern Arabia), located on the shore of the <em>Ba\u1e25r-i F\u0101rs</em> (Persian Gulf).\u00a0It is fortified with walls and a trench, and it is two days\u2019 journey from <em>La\u1e25s\u0101</em> (al-A\u1e25s\u0101\u2019?), the provincial capital. [translation]</p>",
